      "id": 1,
      "text": "Sedgwick was named after Major General John Sedgwick of the Union Army, a legacy carried from Fort Sedgwick to the town itself.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
